---
name: Fetch HarfangLab events as ECS and archive them
description: |
  Drains the Elastic pull export of a HarfangLab Manager, keeps a compressed
  copy of every document, and publishes the ECS documents.
---

// The Manager deletes every event it returns, so archive them before any
// further processing. The archive allows replaying them later.
harfanglab::fetch "https://example.hurukai.io:8443",
  token=secret("harfanglab-api-token"),
  format="ecs"
fork {
  to_file "/var/lib/tenzir/harfanglab/ecs-{uuid}.ndjson.gz" {
    write_ndjson
    compress_gzip
  }
}
publish "harfanglab"
